With stories set in Ireland, England, and Italy, this rich collection perfectly exemplifies Trevor's three great qualities: subtlety, honesty, and humanity. A fond depiction of the sad, anticlimactic moments in ordinary lives by a master of the short story."
‹Ena musteriodes nesi. Ena egkataleimmeno orphanotropheio. Mia perierge sulloge apo polu paraxenes photographies.
Ola anamenoun na anakaluphthoun sto Mis Peregkrin - Stege gia Asunethista Paidia, ena axekhasto muthistorema pou anameignuei te logotekhnia kai te photographia se mia sunarpastike anagnostike empeiria. Sto xekinema tes istorias mas, mia phobere oikogeneiake tragodia othei ton dekaexakhrono Tzeikomp na taxidepsei se ena apomonomeno nesi konta stis aktes tes Oualias opou anakaluptei ta katarreonta khalasmata tes Steges gia Asunethista Paidia tes Mis Peregkrin. Kathos o Tzeikomp exereuna ta egkataleimmena upnodomatia kai tous diadromous, suneidetopoiei oti ta paidia etan kati perissotero apo apla asunethista. Mporei na etan epikinduna. Mporei na briskontan se karantina se ena eremonesi gia sostous logous. Kai me kapoio tropo -oso adianoeto ki an phainetai- mporei na einai akome zontana."
‹O anthropos pou parasuretai apo ena taxi se mia diabase pezon. O mousikos-suggrapheas pou upoduetai ton ntetektib. E Anna pou upopteuetai oti o suzugos tes ten apata. E psukhiatros pou analuei ta aitia tes melagkholias. To "Langsamer Satz" tou Bempern. E serbitora pou o antras tes xulophortonei metanastes. O Iasonas pou spoudazei Istoria. E elikiomene pou ekhei pagideutei sto parelthon. O esthonos sunthetes pou dolophoneitai.
Oloi tous mele mias eterokletes orkhestras birtouozon tes kathemerinotetas, pou graphoun kuklous sta pezodromia tes kinoumenes poles, kunegiountai astamateta san tous deiktes tou rologiou s' ena plegma khronon pou plesiazoun, diakladonontai, temnontai e agnoountai, kai peripheroun ta periskopika tous blemmata tragoudontas me aikhmera retsitatibi e akariaies aries ten Anthropine Komodia, te dike tous epanalambanomene istoria, pagideumenoi sto kentro enos adusopetou iliggou."‘
Stis leptomereies sunantiomaste, mesa stous pente dromous e stis pente grammes, sto pentagrammo mias methusmenes tzaz kata to souroupo.
Stis xekourdistes notes, tis asuntaktes, briskomaste, sta mikropragmata eroteuomaste, sta asemanta pragmata.
Kuliomenes slales, mia rogme sto metro, pantophles, pitzames, ena bazo toursi sto psugeio, to santouits, ena palio agapemeno biblio, to makhairi, to oplo, e paidike elikia, to skhema tou stethous sou, oi phones sto kephali, kho-kho, mia parelase, mia krauge, mia aporia, xaplomene sten ebe mia zeste agonia.
Me kati tetoia ulika skaronoun to kharte tous gia na brethoun o Tengko kai e Aomame.
Ma ospou na smixoun, smigei o khronos me ton topo, to emerologio me to kharte, e klepsudra me ten puxida, smigoun, trelainontai, ginontai o alethinos eautos tous kai anatinazontai se duo khloma kai prasina pheggaria apo kharti.
Kai den teleionoun, pote.
Oute to aristourgematiko magnum opus tou Kharouki Mourakami teleionei, okhi st' aletheia. Aplos, e aphegese khamelonei to blemma kai krubetai etsi opos tes aresei na kanei, krubetai anamesa sto mega Pote kai to mikrotato Panta, anasainei, nostalgei, oneireuetai kai sopainei thriambeuontas erotika, adiallakta. Meta, xespitonetai pali kai bgainei stous dromous, philereme, aporemene, erotolepte, e aphegese bgainei sto adexio pentagrammo tes tzaz kai sunekhizei, kai sunekhizetai.
Ki etsi antamonoume, ki etsi eroteuomaste pali..."•
’O k. Asemenios skephtotan pos e duskolia tou aute sta podia, apotelese to megalutero ephodio ki okhi empodio, opos tha legane polloi* gia na mporesei na pragmatopoiesei te diadrome, me phonto tis grammes tou Elektrikou. Ton othousan ta arrostemena tou podia me enan tropo anexegeto, kati pou se ola ta iatrika biblia den uparkhei, oute mesa sta diplomata anapheretai, oute se kamia khaotike melete. E duname tes psukhes den mporei na meletethei apo kanena sustema, apo kamia statistike, oute oi khtupoi tes kardias otan eroteuomaste. Tipota apolutos den mporei na ta exegesei ola auta. Kamia, ma kamia diagnose. Mono to aggigma mporei na giatrepsei to mualo."–
“Edo kai kairo e kardia to arneisai, Axl, to xero. Alla tora erthe e ora na to xanaskephteis. Prepei na kanoume ena taxidi, khoris kamia anabole...
S' ena apomonomeno khorio sten Agglia, ten epokhe ton thrulon, ligo meta ton thanato tou basilia Arthourou, zei ena elikiomeno zeugari Bretanon, o Axl kai e Mpeatris. Oi anamneseis tous einai tholes, opos kai olon ton katoikon, logo mias musteriodous omikhles pou prokalei ena eidos phthoras. Para ten arrostia tes Mpeatris, to zeugari apophasizei na aphesei ten asphaleia tou spitiou tou me skopo na taxidepsei makria kai na brei ton gio tou, pou ekhei na dei edo kai khronia.
Allote agrio kai allote sugkinetiko, to kainourgio muthistorema tou Isigkouro einai ena paramuthi gia tis khamenes mnemes, ten agape, ten ekdikese kai ton polemo."—
”Ten eida prote phora na katebainei apo ena lanto, otan erthan oikogeneiakos sta Pegadakia. O khronos pagose, den eikha xanadei tipota pio omorpho ste zoe mou. Ta matia tes paikhnidiarika, me mia sageneutike melagkholia me prokalousan na paixo mazi tous. Ekeine te stigme gennetheke o erotas mou gia te Bioleta. Zesame te neoteta mas sta khronia tou B' Pagkosmiou Polemou ste Zakuntho, se mia epokhe pou semadeuteke apo ten Katokhe, ena nauagio sten Adriatike kai mia dolophonia...
Kunegemenoi apo ta stereotupa, emastan anagkasmenoi na kruboume ten agape mas, mias kai pisteuame se diaphoretikous theous. Emeis omos xerame oti oi theoi mas mekhaneutekan enan oloklero polemo gia na gnoristoume kai meta na mas khorisoun. Ostoso, den tha upokuptame se kamia theike entole kai se kanenan anthropino nomo. E Bioleta etan to phos pou gemise ten kardia mou, o lebantes pou mou khaidepse ten psukhe. O thesauros mou, e Bioleta mou, etan to eisiterio mou gia ten athanasia, to thauma pou tha esoze tis anamneseis mou, otan tha tis apeilouse e lethe..."˜	
•	Tesseris philoi kai sumphoitetes metakomizoun, meta ten apophoitese tous, ste Nea Uorke gia na phtiaxoun te zoe tous - aphragkoi, khamenoi, me mono tous sterigma te philia tous kai tis philodoxies tous: O eugenes, oraios Gouilem, epidoxos ethopoios* o Tzei Mpi, zographos apo to Mprouklin, pou prospathei na kataktesei ton kallitekhniko kosmo* o Malkolm, arkhitektonas se mia semantike etaireia* kai o Tzount - o idiophues, ainigmatikos Tzount. Opos pernoun oi dekaeties, oi skheseis tous bathainoun, alla kai skoteiniazoun, kathos tis khromatizoun o ethismos, e epitukhia, e perephania. Ostoso e spoudaiotere proklese, suneidetopoioun oloi, einai o idios o Tzount, pleon enas apisteuta kharismatikos dikegoros ma kai enas anthropos oloena kai pio dialumenos, me to soma tou kai ton nou tou semademena apo tous aneipotous tromous tes paidikes tou elikias - kunegemenos apo traumata pou phobatai oti okhi mono den tha xeperasei pote, alla kai tha ton orizoun gia panta. Me proza plousia kai lampre, e Gianagkikhara graphei enan tragiko, uperbatiko umno sten agape, mia aristotekhnike apeikonise tou sparagmou, tes turannias tes mnemes kai ton orion tes anthropines antokhes."™
–Den skotosa ego te Lor nte Gkrenantin Mpouatez ki as eikha kathe logo na epithumo ton thanato tes... Etsi arkhizei ten aphegese tes e ainigmatike Dona Estephana, prosopike giatrissa tes Bereggarias apo te Nabara, tes omorphes suzugou tou Leontokardou.
Mesa tes dekaetias tou 1950. Mia Eggleza buzantinologos, enas Gallos palaiographos ki enas nearos Ellenas mathematikos kalountai epeigontos sten Kupro gia na axiologesoun ena kheirographo pou khronologeitai sten periodo tes Trites Staurophorias. Sto keimeno anapheretai ena duskolo mathematiko problema, pou paremene aluto apo ten epokhe tou Ptolemaiou, alla kai enas musteriodes phonos. Ta pragmata periplekontai otan oi treis empeirognomones ginontai martures, okhtakosia khronia argotera, enos akoma phonou...
Ena adiakopo pegaine-ela anamesa se duo epokhes, diple intrigka, diplo musterio. Ki ola auta, kato apo tous aionious, oikoumenikous nomous ton katoptron."

š
To 1969 e zographos Emma Regies esteile ston philo tes istoriko Kherman Arsiniegas ten prote apo tis eikosi treis epistoles pou perigraphoun tis skleres sunthekes mesa stis opoies kulese e paidike tes elikia. O philos tes sugklonisteke apo tis epodunes autes anamneseis ki apophasise na deixei ta keimena ston Gkampriel Gkarsia Markes, o opoios entharrune te Regies na sunekhisei to grapsimo. E allelographia kratese os to 1997* s' auto to diastema, o Arsiniegas kataphere na parei ten egkrise tes Emma Regies gia na ekdosei tis epistoles meta ton thanato tes.
Me mia graphe pou xekhorizei gia ten entimoteta kai ten apousia kathe epitedeuses, e Regies aphegeitai tis antixootetes ton paidikon tes khronon sten Kolombia stis arkhes tou 20ou aiona, otan ten egkateleipsan mazi me ten aderphe tes s' ena monasteri. Khoris autolupese, me euphuIa enelikou kai matia koritsiou, kataphernei na metadosei me akribeia ston anagnoste ta sunaisthemata tes.
Mia realistike kai empneusmene perigraphe tou pos kapoios mporei na anaduthei apo athlies sunthekes kai na xekhorisei.
Kirkus Reviews
Oi anagnostes, kathos diabazoume tis Anamneseis di' allelographias, epises megalonoume apotoma, opos e Emma Regies, kai khamogelame.
El Pais
Ena kataplektiko keimeno pou, perissotero apo pote, einai e idia e zoe.
ABC Cultural"£
 O suggrapheas tes seiras mpest seler me ton Khari Khole graphei aute te phora ena exairetika dunato muthistorema me skeniko enan laburintho diaphthoras sta upselotera kubernetika klimakia. O Soni einai enas paraxena kharismatikos kai makarios nearos andras pou ekhei perasei to megalutero meros tes zoes tou ste phulake (dodeka khronia), oi sugkratoumenoi tou epizetoun na brethoun gia ligo sto keli mazi tou khare sten apokosme ikanoteta tou na paregorei kai na kateunazei tis psukhikes tous entaseis. Den tous endiapherei phusika pou o Soni einai eroinomanes oute apo pou prometheuetai narkotika oute oti ektiei ten poine gia egklemata pou den ekhei diapraxei o idios..."¬
©Megale einai e anastatose pou phernei o xakoustos giatros Sumeon Mpakamarte sten apokoimismene komopole tes Brazilianikes endokhoras ap' opou katagetai. Egkataleipontas te lampre stadiodromia tou sten Europe, epistrephei gia na ereunesei to phainomeno tes trellas pano sten plate ton sumpoliton tou, pou ton blepoun kataplektoi na idruei ena phrenokomeio kai na tous kleinei olous mesa! "Prokeitai", iskhurizetai, "gia ena peirama, pou tha allaxei ten opse tes ges. E trella etheoreito ena nesi khameno ston okeano tes logikes* arkhizo na upopteuomai pos prokeitai gia mia epeiro". Ti einai e trella kai poios einai o Sumeon Mpakamarte; Autos pou ten therapeuei e autos pou ten epinoei; Kai poios einai o trellos; Oi ligoi, oi polloi e o idios o phreniatros; (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"°
­O Dounabes einai ena prosopiko stokhastiko taxidi kata mekos ton 2.888 khiliometron tou potamou, apo tis diaphilonikoumenes peges tou ste Germania os tis ekboles tou ste Maure Thalassa (sto periphemo limani Soulina, topo drases tes beristikes operas tou Spurou Samara <>), pou metatrepetai se mia sunarpastike aphegese guro apo to thema ton sunoron kai tes tautotetas. To sunoro e ta sunora, to edo kai to pera, to gnosto kai to agnosto ste dialektike skhese tous, apoteloun te sunistosa tou Dounabe, alla kai olou tou ergou tou Magkris. O Dounabes, autos o germano-magiaro-slabo-romano-ebraikos potamos, pou potizei kuriolektika te Mitteleuropa (eite os pragmatike geographia eite os logotekhnike) kai apotelei apo monos tou mian oikoumene, dinei ten eukairia ston Magkris na demiourgesei mia aphegese-potamo, opou e geographia, to topio, e geopolitike sunantoun ten istoria kai sunomiloun me tis phones tes suneideses tes, ton Khaintegger, ton Selin, ton Gkrilpartzer, ton Kaphka, ton Kaneti, ton PanaIt Istrati kai tosous allous. Uparkhei kalutere metaphora apo to potami os kat' exokhen eikona tes anazeteses pano sten tautoteta; Apo ten epokhe tou Erakleitou, xeroume pos okhi. Oso gia ton megalutero poiete tou Dounabe, ton Khailnterlin, o potamos einai <>.
(apo ten eisagoge tou Nikou Mpakounake)
***
O Klaountio Magkris gennetheke sten Tergeste to 1939. Einai kathegetes germanikes philologias sto Panepistemio tes Tergestes kai taktikos sunergates tes ephemeridas Corriere della Sera.
Ekhei metaphrasei sta italika Klaist, Ipsen, Snitsler, Mpukhner kai ekhei grapsei meletes gia to ergo ton Kaphka, Mouzil, Xophmanstal, Loukats, Giozeph Pot, Pilke, Sbebo, Kaneti, Singker kai allon.
O Dounabes, to koruphaio ergo tou, kuklophorese to 1986. Timetheke me to brabeio Erasmus 2000 kai me to brabeio kaluterou xenou dokimiou ste Gallia to 1990.
Sta ellenika ekhoun kuklophoresei kai ta biblia tou Mikrokosmoi (Polis, 2005) kai Sta tuphla (Diegese, 2009).
Milontas gia to talento tou Magkris, o kritikos tes Le Monde Pierre Lepape graphei: <>.
Kai o Mikhales Metsos sta Prosopa graphei:
<>."µ
²<>
To Niophuto olisthainei kai oi katoikoi tou tha zesoun me oristiko tropo te khalase. Kai kathos to allote oreino khorio metatrepetai se parathalassio theretro, treis Ragkoudaioi, o Loukas, o prototokos gios tou kai o eggonos tou Adamantios, to phteroto agori pou tha ginei o kalligraphos, tha kleistoun mesa se enan laburintho apo glupta poulia. Kai oi treis tha plerosoun to akribo antitimo gia to aima pou koubala e oikogeneia stis plates tes* giati to aima epistrephei, to aima den xekhna, akhnizei ekei opou khutheke ki otan akoma to ekhei rouphexei e ge."¶
³Tis teleutaies meres tou 2004, s' ena khorioudaki tes Tsetsenias, e oktakhrone Khabaa krubetai sto dasos otan oi rosikes stratiotikes dunameis arpazoun ton patera tes. O geitonas tous, Akhment, enas apotukhemenos giatros, ten phugadeuei sto bombardismeno nosokomeio tes pio kontines poles, opou e monadike giatros, e Rosida Sonia, perithalpei ena adiakopo kuma traumatismenon antarton kai prosphugon, eno penthei gia ten exaphanismene adelphe tes. Mesa se pente dramatikes meres, o Akhment kai e Sonia anatrekhoun o kathenas sto diko tou parelthon, psakhnontas na lusoun enan musteriode gripho sumptoseon, prodosias kai suggnomes pou tous denei aprosdoketa kai apophasizei gia te moira tous."À
½Anthropoi pou basanizontai exisou apo te monaxia kai apo te suntrophikoteta, anthropoi pou stekontai amekhanoi kai amphithumoi mprosta ste zoe opos aute suntithetai apo ta adiexoda ton erotikon skheseon kai tes oikogeneias, ten aneparkeia tou atomou kai tes koinonias, tis pagides tes mnemes kai to anapotrepto tou thanatou, anthropoi pou bionoun ten uparxe pote me apognose kai pote me apatheia, pote me empedomene thlipse kai pote me khioumor."À
½Mia zeste kalokairine bradia sto Amsterntam duo pantremena zeugaria bgainoun gia phageto se ena modato estiatorio. Suzetane gia diaphora tetrimmena zetemata, te douleia, tis diakopes, tis prosphates tainies, alla oles autes oi aerologies einai mia apopeira gia na sugkalupsoun ten entase pou epikratei metaxu tous.
Oi dekapentakhronoi gioi tous ekhoun diapraxei mazi ena egklema to opoio ekhei katagraphei apo kamera. Oi eikones ekhoun metadothei apo ten teleorase alla ta duo agoria den ekhoun tautopoiethei akome. Ostoso e sullepse tous epikeitai.
Kathos to deipno phtanei ste gastrimargike tou koruphose, ta prosopeia tes politismenes sumperiphoras pephtoun. Ta makhairia bgainoun. Os pou einai diatetheimenoi na phtasoun gia na prostateusoun ta paidia tous;
"O Koch erkhetai me phora apo ten Europe me mia istoria toso entone, pou tha sas kopsei ten orexe". (US Today.com)
"Ena erethistiko ripleiko drama".
(O, The Oprah Magazine)
"To deipno xekina me pota kai skoteine satira kai siga siga se stoikheionei. Einai tromaktiko, nosero, euphues, sokaristiko kai apo ta biblio pou den mporeis n' apheseis ap' ta kheria sou. Diabaste to san na katebazete mia gennaia goulia kai meta kanoniste na sunantesete tous philous sas - tha to suzetate gia ores".
(Gilliam Flynn, suggrapheas)
""To deipno" einai ena kathelotiko kai exaisia anesukhetiko anagnosma. Opos e kale satira einai tautokhrona dektiko kai para polu asteio... Euphuestato, auto to muthistorema einai tautokhrona grothia sto stomakhi alla kai tonotike enese. Katharizei ten atmosphaira. Uperokho biblio.
(Christos Tsiolkas, suggrapheas)"È
ÅTa pente diegemata tes Teleutaias proeidopoieses sunthetoun dexiotekhnikous aphegematikous laburinthous, odegontas ton anagnoste se ena paradoxo alla oikeio sumpan. Arkhitektonikoi antikatoptrismoi, phasmatikes eikones, idees kai antikeimena demiourgoun enan endiameso topo opou askeitai e upsele tekhne tes tauromanteias, opou e eleuse tes eutukhias exartatai apo ena telephonema, o khartes enos khoriou anadeiknuetai se iero keimelio, ena arkhaio phrourio dinei ten aphorme gia mia allokote epistemonike diamakhe, eno o kurios Gklas diaskhizei olomonakhos mia kainourgia Amerike."È
ÅApo tis geitonies mias mikres ouggrikes poles, ste Boudapeste, ste Nea Uorke kai allou, akolouthoume te maniake phone tou Gkiorgki Korim, tou eroa tou Polemos kai polemos, autou tou tapeinou, thlimmenou graphia. Apelpismenos, ores ores skhedon trelos, alla epises entona sunaisthematikos, o Korim ekhei anakalupsei, sta skonismena Arkheia tes mikres ouggrikes poles opou ergazetai, ena kheirographo to opoio epi dekaeties den ekhei aggixei kaneis. To sugklonistikes poietikes omorphias keimeno existorei ten periplanese tessaron suntrophon, pou polemesan mazi s' enan katastrophiko polemo kai agonizontai tora na epistrepsoun spiti tous kai na xephugoun apo ton ameilikto kosmo tes bias. Sugkinemenos apo ton exairetika eualoto kharaktera ton eroon tou kheirographou, o Korim thetei os skopo tes zoes tou na metabibasei ston kosmo to zotikes semasias menuma tou keimenou pou molis anakalupse. Apophasizei na ekplerosei auto to kathekon ste Nea Uorke, pou apotelei gia keinon to "kentro tou kosmou".
Akolouthontas ton Korim me epimono realismo se ole tou te diadrome, kai kurios stous dromous tes Neas Uorkes, to Polemos kai polemos -ena apo ta semantikotera kai pleon philodoxa biblia autou tou Ouggrou "maitr tes Apokalupses", opos ton apokalei e Susan Sontag- mas metapherei me sugklonistiko kai anthropino tropo s' enan kosmo pou dikhazetai anamesa sten agrioteta kai te maniode omorphia.
Me graphe pou den moiazei me kamia alle, to Polemos kai polemos epibebaionei ta logia tou W. B. Sebald oti e proza tou Krasnakhorkai "xeperna kata polu oles tis essonos semasias anesukhies tes sugkhrones graphes"."Ë
ÈOtan mpeke sto souper market, kateuthuntheke sta raphia me tis mpires. Pere ena koutaki, to anoixe kai epie. Ti skephteke kathos esbene te dipsa tou, auto den to xero. Ekeino omos gia to opoio eimai bebaios einai oti anamesa ste stigme pou mpeke kai ste stigme pou ton stamatesan oi phulakes, kaneis den phantazotan oti den tha xanabgaine zontanos.
E empneuse gia ten istoria aute proelthe apo mia eidese sta psila ton ephemeridon, gia ena peristatiko pou sunebe ste Luon ton Dekembrio tou 2009.
Ta muthistoremata tou Loran Mobinie prospathoun na oriothetesoun to pragmatiko, sugkrouontai omos me to arreto, sta sunora tou logou. Mia glossa pou paskhizei na brei logia gia ten apousia kai ten apoleia, ton erota kai ten elleipse - san mia apopeira na sugkratesoume auto pou glistra mesa apo ta dakhtula mas, mesa apo ta khronia pou pernoun."Ë	
È	E apophase duo gunaikon na sosoun ena paidi kata te diarkeia tou B' pagkosmiou polemou tha odegesei se aprobleptes sunepeies, se bathos dekaetion.
1944 Rome. Oi germanikes dunameis katokhes mazeuoun apo ten italike proteuousa kai phortonoun sta phortega tous teleutaious Ebraious. Anamesa tous einai kai e oikogeneia Lebi. E mana ston paniko tes petaei skhedon ton ephtakhrono gio tes Ntaniele sten agkalia mias agnostes kopelas, pou parakolouthei entrome te skene. E Kiara Rabelo tha sosei to paidi. Tha to agapesei. Tha to megalosei. Kai tha to khasei.
E Kiara einai e mia apo tis duo aphegetries tes istorias. E deutere, e Maria, tha parei to nema sta kheria tes trianta khronia argotera kai tha to xetulixei taxideuontas apo ten Oualia ste Rome tes dekaetias tou '70.
E istoria tes Kiara kai tou Ntaniele, pou xetuligetai sto theatro tou Polemou, xepernaei te bia, ton tromo kai ton pono pou sphragisan ekeine ten periodo kai koitazei me tharros, megalopsukhia kai eilikrineia tis pio prosopikes, tis pio alethines kai duskoles stigmes ton kurion kharakteron tes.
E Mpeili katorthonei sto "Ena proi, noris" kati spanio, na aphegethei ten istoria apla khoris ostoso na thusiasei tipota apo to bathos kai ten omorphia tes."Ø
ÕGegonota mias Istorias duo aionon, biomata traumatika pou apothesame bathia mesa mas* xekhasmenes khreokopies me te sphragida tes amatheias kai tes demagogias* kriseis pou mas upodoulosan sten endeia, stis planes kai sto pseudos* polemoi polunekroi* emphulioi adelphoktonoi kai apothemenoi* gegonota pou ta apothesame ste lethe gia na glitosoume apo te phrike kai tis tupseis - eno e mone katharse tha etan e mneme kai e epignose tous. As anoixoume ta matia kai ten psukhe mas sten Istoria, pou exorizei te lethe kai phernei ten A-letheia. Apo ta aitia tes krises, to biblio anazetei ta bathutera: auta pou xerizonontai duskolotera giati einai gera rizomena ste neoellenike Istoria. Aitia pou epanalambanontai stis epta ptokheuseis pou biosan oi Ellenes apo to 1824 eos tis meres mas. An oi ellenes polites gnorizan ta sphalmata pou odegesan stis exi protes ptokheuseis tes Istorias mas, tha eikha me apophugei ten ebdome. An oi ellenes politikoi gnorizan ta sphalmata pou odegesan stous emphulious polemous tes Istorias mas, tha eikhan apokeruxei tis emphuliopolemikes tous demagogies. Auta ta apla pragmata thelo kurios na po me auto to biblio, to teleutaio pou grapho, giati saranta khronia sto epaggelma tou istorikou kai tou daskalou einai baru phortio.
E emphuliopolemike demagogia odegei se diktatoria me koureliasmeno mandua pseudokoinobouleutismou. Baria e lexe, alla okhi adike. Einai arage asemantes oi anoesies kai oi pseuties ton "ekprosopon tou Laou" pou parelaunoun stis othones; Einai mepos tukhaioi oi pseutodiaxiphismoi kai oi allelokategories, ta skismena mnemonia, oi elastikes suneideseis kai ta anuparkta e pseude "pothen eskhes"; Kai einai periergo pou oi misoi toulakhiston Ellenes ekhoun upobalei ten paraitese tous os psephophoroi kai os polites kai aphenontai sto eleos ton phaulon, anikanon, amorphoton kai anoeton anthropon pou psephizoun tous nomous tou ekastote aphente-prothupourgou;
Ostoso, den einai skoteines oles oi selides tou bibliou. Uparkhoun kai oi parentheseis tes aisiodoxias pou khreiazomaste gia na pairnoume kouragio enantia sten paraitese. Stis parentheseis autes prospatho na deixo pote kai pos einai pithano kai ephikto na teleiosei e krise. Me aisiodoxia, loipon, kleinei to biblio, kai makari na bgo alethinos."Û
ØTi tha dialege enas anthropos pou autoktonese an, ston allo kosmo, tou dinotan e dunatoteta na xanagennethei; Treis diasemes suggrapheis, thrulikes toso gia to ergo tous oso kai gia to gegonos oti edosan oi idies telos ste zoe tous, kalountai na apantesoun sto erotema, me odego kai uperete tous enan poiete kai idaniko autokheira kai mia daimonia mekhane. Keimeno tes emmonikes mou niotes kai tes agonias mou gia te these tes zoes ston iskio enos lutrotikou thanatou, e Autogonia apotelei ten tapeine mou apopeira na pselaphiso to musterio tes anthropines katastases sta oria tes, kai pera apo auta."İ
ÚO epitheoretes Khari Khole apospatai apo te Dioxe Egklematon tou Oslo sto Sidnei gia na parakolouthesei ten ereuna pou diexagoun oi topikes arkhes gia ten exikhniase enos phonou. O Khari mporei na prospherei te boetheia tou alla ekhei retes odegies na men mplexei. To thuma einai mia eikositriakhrone Norbegida pou einai diaseme sten patrida tes. Phusika, o Khari den mporei na meinei aplos parateretes kai sundeetai philika me ton epitheorete pou einai epikephales tes ereunas kathos kai me enan apo tous martures, me apotelesma na brethei anamemeigmenos me ten ereuna. Oi treis autoi anthropoi tha anakalupsoun pos e dolophonia tes kopelas einai mono o teleutaios krikos mias alusidas anexikhniaston phonon. Ekhoun loipon na antimetopisoun enan psukhopathe pou dra se ole ten Australia. Kathos o kloios arkhizei na kleinei guro apo ton draste, o Khari phobatai oti kaneis den einai pia asphales - oute kan autoi pou ereunoun ten upothese.
BRABEIA
Riverton Prize 1997: Kalutero Norbegiko Astunomiko Muthistorema tes Khronias
Glass Key (Glasnyckeln) 1998: Kalutero Skandinabiko Astunomiko Muthistorema tes Khronias"à
İKaneis den einai teleios. Parola auta polloi anthropoi thetoun - toso gia ton eauto tous oso kai gia tous allous - polu upsela stantarnt. To apotelesma einai enokhe, thumos, katathlipse kai apogoeteuse. Se auto to empneusmeno mpest seler, o Harold Kushner mas didaskei pos mporoume na mathoume na apodekhomaste ton eauto mas kai tous allous, akome kai otan autoi den einai teleioi. Antlontas apo ten Palaia Diatheke, te sugkhrone logotekhnia, ten psukhologia, te theologia kai ten triakontaete empeiria tou os rabbinou, o Kushner mas deikhnei pos e apodokhe kai e sugkhorese mporoun na allaxoun tis skheseis mas me tous pio semantikous anthropous ste zoe mas kai mas boethaei na antimetopisoume ten proklese tou na eimaste anthropoi."ë
èKseroume semera kalutera tis diergasies genneses autou tou ergou zoes, autou tou aperantou potamou lexeon pou sugklonise te logotekhnia tou 20ou aiona, ste Gallia alla kai s' olo ton kosmo. O anagnostes erkhetai edo s' epaphe sunama me mia epopoiia tes skepses, m' ena taxidi stous laburinthous tou kosmikou, kallitekhnikou kai dianoetikou stereomatos tes epokhes tou Proust, me mian axiothaumaste psukhologike melete, ki ola auta sten uperesia mias anepanaleptes glossas. Kseroume epises tis peristaseis tou thanatou tou Marsel Proust, ten eggraphe tes lexes "telos" kai ten upagoreuse ton teleutaion phraseon, ten exantlese tou suggraphea apo toute ten anazetese kai anakalupse tou khamenou khronou. Kseroume isos ligotero tis peristaseis pou odegesan sten emphanise tes ellenikes metaphrases tou ergou: ekhoume na kanoume edo me tis duskolies, ten oxuderkeia kai te duname enos anthropou, mesa apo tis opoies gennetheke kai prospheretai semera stous anagnostes to "Anazetontas ton khameno khrono"."í
êE musteriodes exaphanise tes progiagias tes apo to gerokomeio tou Seiker Khaits phernei te Linor Mpintsman se plere sunaisthematike sugkhuse. Auto einai ena monakha apo ta problemata tes atukhes telephonetrias: o desmos tes me to aphentiko tes, Rik Bigkorous, ginetai oloena kai pio periplokos, o papagalos tes, Blant o Paloukotes, emphanizetai sto Khristianiko Radioteleoptiko Diktuo, eno polles alles mikres katastrophes sampotaroun ten prospatheia tes Linor gia agape kai autopragmatose."ğ
íE dieisdutike matia tes Mansphelnt epikentronetai stis gunaikes tes epokhes tes. Graphei stis arkhes tou 20ou aiona, otan oi souphrazetes diadelonoun kai phulakizontai sten Agglia. Graphei gia tis gunaikes pou talanteuontai anamesa sten upotage ston andra kai tis protes deiles prospatheies kheirapheteses tous. Blepei ten upokrisia kai tis autapates tous, tis kruphes stigmes tes apognoses kai tou thriambou tous. Oi antres guro tes einai axestoi e blakes pou mporoun na prospheroun mono bia, anoete aphosiose e ten upodoulose tou gamou kai ton paidion. Anarronontas apo ten apobole tes kai ton suntomo gamo tes, graphei ta prota diegemata tes sulloges Se mia germanike pansion -kapoia san protoprosopes satirikes spoudes pano stous sugkatoikous tes sten pansion, alla san peridiabasmata poles me klephtes maties stis krebatokamares ton spition kai stis zoes pou asphuktioun se kleista, uperbolika zesta domatia-, plathontas eikones pou anaduontai me anapantekhe elaphrada eno emperikleioun ten tragodia."ö
ó"I'm homeless, but in first class."
Stathis Rakis has abandoned his small Greek village for a more worldly life, first in San Francisco, where the dot-com bubble had already burst, and then in Paris, France, at a top business school. After falling in love with a liberal New England journalist with a good conscience (but with some scores to settle), Stathis moves to the United States to work as a management consultant for a high-octane company called Command. He spends the very few hours of the day that aren't consumed by work draining the minibar of whichever five-star hotel he's currently calling home, battling insomnia, and bingeing on more than room service. Luxury is a given; happiness is not.
As the economy recovers and a new bubble expands in a post-9/11 world, Stathis drifts upward, bearing witness to the criminal decadence that will become the 2008 financial crisis while developing his own habits of indulgence--drugs, sex, and insider trading. In a world of insatiability that features both corporate suits and Hollywood hedonism, Stathis remains the outsider: too foreign to be one of them, too cynical to turn back."÷
ôE Petroupole den uparkhei, aplos nomizoume oti uparkhei. Se aute te phasmatike pole, opou pantou peripherontai skies, opou puknonoun oi phasaries stous dromous, opou ta gegonota booun oti epikeitai e epanastase tou 1905, oi psukhes ton eroon kai ton anagnoston, oi morphes tes zoes kai tes aphegeses briskontai ligo prin ten katarreuse.
O nearos Nikolai Apollonobits Ampleoukhoph, enas rizospastes dandes, meta apo mia erotike apogoeteuse analambanei na topothetesei mia bomba ston sebasto gerousiaste kai patera tou, Apollon Apollonobits Ampleoukhoph. O orologiakos mekhanismos energopoieitai, o khronos kai o khoros tes aphegeses diastellontai, gia na perilaboun oles tis pneumatikes, politikes kai aisthetikes entaseis tes metaikhmiakes ekeines epokhes."ù
öNeddy Merrill decides to swim home from a friend's pool party, traveling from fashionable swimming pool to swimming pool on a perfect mid-summer's day. But as night falls and the season changes, Neddy sinks from optimistic bliss to utter despair."ù
öAuto to biblio einai apotelesma saranta eton ereunas, stokhasmou, suggraphes kai didaskalias gia ton Ethniko Dikhasmo. Epidioxe tou einai e katanoese, e exegese, e ermeneia. Okhi e exumnese, oute e kataggelia. An demiourgethei ston anagnoste e entupose oti to biblio meroleptei uper tou Eleutheriou Benizelou, auto prokuptei apo ta idia ta pragmata, okhi apo prothese.
Aphou parousiastoun ta kuriotera gegonota apo to 1909 eos kai to 1922, o Ethnikos Dikhasmos ermeneuetai os oionei threskeutiko "skhisma" kharismatikes proeleuses, os krise ste diadikasia ethnikes olokleroses, os taxike sugkrouse, alla kai os diamakhe pou apektese tis diastaseis emphuliou polemou. Me ten ermeneia mporei na diaphonesei kaneis. Okhi omos me ta gegonota sta opoia basizetai."ù
öKatadikasmenos ste sobaroteta kai sten upokrisia, o Khoulio, o siopelos eroas autou tou bibliou, peithetai telika pos to kalutero pou ekhei na kanei einai na kleistei sto domatio tou kai na paraterei to megaloma enos mponsai para na periplanietai stous duskolous dromous tes logotekhnias.
To "Mponsai", opos leei o suggrapheas, einai mia "istoria analaphre pou ginetai baria", mia elleiptike kai iliggiodes aphegese pou semadeuetai apo ten anesukhetike exaphanise mias gunaikas.
O Khorkhe Louis Mporkhes elege pos prepei na graphoume san na suntassoume ten perilepse enos ede grammenou bibliou. Ki auto akribos kanei o Alekhantro Sampra s' auto to biblio, pou -me ton idio tropo pou ena mponsai den einai ena dentro- den einai toso ena suntomo muthistorema e ena megalo aphegema, alla ena muthistorema-perilepse, e telika auto akribos pou delonei o titlos tou, ena muthistorema-mponsai."‚
ÿTo uuthistoreua Skenes apo ton bio tou Matias Aluosino einai e anoikhte palaue enos kheriou pou akouupaei ston kharte tes Europes tou 17ou aiona, eno kathe dakhtulo tes aphegeses, deikhnei kai diaphoretiko seueio tou orizonta - e Agglia tou Neutona kai tes Basilikes Etaireias, to anexithresko Austerntau ton euporon, e pagouene Petroupole tou tsarou uetarruthuiste, e Benetia tes uaskas... O karpos tou kheriou aggizei ten othouanike aperantosune, te Thessalonike, ten Konstantinoupole kai ton Khandaka, ta oria tes Europes.
O Matias Aluosino, kruptoebraios ste Basileia tes Elbetias, diaskhizei apo truphere elikia te Respublica Christiana, te khristianike epikrateia, orphanos ue ton tropo tou Ntikens kai desuios tes theokratikes katadunasteuses tes epokhes tou. Khtizei ten enelikiose tou uesa apo peripeteies, kathos allazei uaskes threskeutikes kai phuletikes tautotetas, dikhasuenos skhedon os to telos apo to uegadiakubeuua pou egkainiazei o aionas tou: te gennese tou episteuonikou logou kai ten anaphlexe tou orthologisuou apenanti ste nostalgia tou thauuatos kai stis pio akraies uessianikes prosdokies. O Spinoza ki apenanti tou oi pio uisallodoxes sugkrouseis, o Ntekart kai o SaupetaiSebi, to suupan ue ta uatia tes neas episteues os uia kalokourdisuene uekhane kai antikru tes e anauone tou telous tou kosuou sta 1666 u.Kh.
Oi topoi ton taxidion allazoun ragdaia se uia plousia skenographia: uia diabase stis Alpeis, e Benetia tes paroikias ton Ebraion kai ton Graikon, e Thessalonike tou Saupetai Sebi, e Pantoba kai to pheuisueno tes panepisteuio, to Tzante, e ptose tou Khandaka, e Konstantinoupole ton thauuaton, to Londino tes neas episteues, topoi tes Geruanias, oi rouuanikes khores ton orthodoxon egeuonon, e epikrateia tou Megalou Petrou ue tis stepes kai ta xekheilisuenapotauia kai, telos, ena oros pou to eipane ?gio.
To uuthistoreua existorei te zoe enos proikisuenou anthropou, giatrou kai polupraguona stokhaste, pou draskelizei khores, glosses, politisuous, pou periplanietai se anthropous kai idees. Ena biblio gia ten istoria tes iatrikes kai tes Europes, ena khroniko tes nostalgias tou Theou kai tes sunanteses ton threskeion, ena odoiporiko ste uelagkholia, sten anazetese tes philosophikes kataphuges ston allo anthropo kai sto prosopo tou.
Ola einai skenes apo te diarkeia uias zoes - skenes uono, giati akoue kai to uuthistoreua adunatei na anaparastesei ton anthropino bio sten oloteta tou."␀␀p@"␀␀@"	®Gáz@"	…ëQ¸@"	…ëQ¸@"	…ëQ¸@"	)\Âõ(@"	)\Âõ(@"	333333@"	=
